      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "If the upload succeeds, the sync resumes with the [`NSFileManagerResumeSyncBehavior.preserveLocalChanges`](nsfilemanagerresumesyncbehavior/preservelocalchanges.md) behavior.",
      "normalizedSource": "If the upload succeeds, the sync resumes with the [`NSFileManagerResumeSyncBehavior.preserveLocalChanges`](nsfilemanagerresumesyncbehavior/preservelocalchanges.md) behavior.",
