      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "If the provider detects a conflict, the upload fails with an [`NSFileWriteUnknownError`](nsfilewriteunknownerror-c.enum.case.md), with the underlying error of [`localVersionConflictingWithServer`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/FileProvider/NSFileProviderError/localVersionConflictingWithServer).",
      "contextAfter": "This scenario is only available on paused items for which the file provider supports the fail-on-conflict behavior.",
